  "welcome.jiagureappear.line1": "Thank you for downloading and playing this mod!",
  "welcome.jiagureappear.line2": "Centered on Jiagu Inscription (Oracle Bone Script), this mod also covers Classical Chinese, Chengyu-Idioms, and other aspects of Chinese language culture.",
  "welcome.jiagureappear.line3": "Press R by default to open the jiagu crafting screen; recipes are available in the Dictionary or JEI, and the advancement tab outlines the mod's progression.",
  "welcome.jiagureappear.line4": "The Jiagu Inscription in this mod is an artistic imitation and re-creation of ancient writing, shaped by the author's subjective interpretation. It differs from real oracle bone script and may contain academic inaccuracies — please do not use it for any academic study or discussion. For characters not found in oracle bone script, this mod derives them from later scripts (such as bronze and seal script) through reasonable inference and imagination.",
